    "reflection": "Paul teaches that God's Spirit enables believers to understand what God has graciously given.\n\nWe need spiritual illumination.\n\nThat does not mean Scripture contains secret meanings available only to unusually spiritual people.\n\nNor does it mean careful reading no longer matters.\n\nThe Holy Spirit opens our understanding so that God's revealed truth is received not merely as information but as spiritual reality.\n\nThere is a difference between knowing that God is faithful and learning to trust His faithfulness when your future feels uncertain.\n\nBetween defining grace and living as someone who has received it.\n\nBetween explaining forgiveness and actually forgiving.\n\nAsk the Spirit to move truth from the page into your thinking, affections and behaviour.\n\nThe goal is not simply:\n\n“I understand this verse.”\n\nThe deeper goal is:\n\n“This truth is transforming me.”",
