    "prayer": "Father, because of Your mercy, I offer myself again to You. Holy Spirit, renew my mind and expose the places where I still resist God's authority. Let my worship become a surrendered life. I belong to You. In Jesus' name, amen.\n\nMovement 3 complete ✅\n\nWe have now drafted:\n\nMovement 1 — Knowing God: Days 1–31 ✅\nMovement 2 — Jesus: Our Saviour & Lord: Days 32–59 ✅\nMovement 3 — Life in the Holy Spirit: Days 60–90 ✅\n\n90 of 365 master devotionals are now drafted.\n\nThere is one architectural distinction we should preserve: Master Days 60–90 are 31 of the master YEAR365 devotionals; they are not themselves the entire HS90 journey. HS90 draws 90 selected days from across the 365-day master collection, including later material on the Fruit of the Spirit, prayer, gifts, discernment, character, mission and Spirit-led living. That keeps the Option B architecture intact and avoids creating a separate second set of Holy Spirit devotionals.\n\nNext is Movement 4 — Faith: Trusting God in Every Season, beginning with Master Day 91 — What Is Faith?"
