    "reflection": "Jesus said:\n\n“Peace I leave with you. My peace I give to you; not as the world gives.”\n\nThe world's version of peace often depends upon circumstances becoming calm.\n\nNo conflict.\n\nNo uncertainty.\n\nNo unexpected bills.\n\nNo difficult conversations.\n\nNo troubling news.\n\nJesus offers a different kind of peace.\n\nHis disciples were about to enter an extremely difficult season, yet He spoke peace to them.\n\nChrist's peace can exist before the circumstances resolve.\n\nThat does not mean anxiety disappears instantly or that Christians never need practical help when struggling.\n\nIt means our deepest security is not dependent upon controlling everything around us.\n\nJesus remains Lord even when life feels unsettled.",
