    "prayer": "Father, search the hidden areas of my life. Show me any place where I protect reputation while compromising character. Give me integrity that remains faithful without an audience. Amen.\n\nMovement 6 progress\n\nDays 152–166 are complete.\n\nWe have covered:\n\nFruit → Love → Joy → Peace → Patience → Kindness → Goodness.\n\nThe next section, Days 167–181, completes Movement 6 with:\n\nFaithfulness → gentleness → self-control → controlling appetites → discipline → emotional self-control → Spirit versus flesh → cultivating fruit in relationships → fruit under pressure → pruning → abiding → a life that bears much fruit.\n\nThat will complete the entire Fruit of the Spirit movement and bring the master journey to 181 of 365 devotionals.\n\nMovement 6 — Fruitful Living\n\nMaster Devotionals: Days 167–181\n\nWe now complete the Fruit of the Spirit movement. These final fifteen days focus on faithfulness, gentleness, self-control, abiding and fruitfulness under pressure.\n\nFAITHFULNESS"
