    "slug": "spirit-versus-flesh",
    "title": "Spirit Versus Flesh",
    "theme": "The inner battle",
    "movement": "Fruitful Living",
    "scriptureReference": "Galatians 5:16–17",
    "book": "galatians",
    "chapter": 5,
    "reflection": "Paul describes a conflict between the flesh and the Spirit.\n\nEvery Christian knows something of this struggle.\n\nPart of you desires what honours God.\n\nAnother desire pulls toward immediate gratification.\n\nThe existence of the battle does not mean the Holy Spirit has abandoned you.\n\nIt means there is a battle to fight.\n\nAnd Paul's answer is not simply:\n\n“Try harder.”\n\nIt is:\n\n“Walk by the Spirit.”\n\nVictory grows from daily dependence.\n\nListen to God's Word.\n\nRespond to conviction.\n\nRemove unnecessary temptation.\n\nBuild wise habits.\n\nPray.\n\nSeek accountability.\n\nChoose obedience repeatedly.\n\nThe flesh says:\n\n“Give me what I want now.”\n\nThe Spirit leads us toward what produces life.",
