    "declaration": "Godly character is more precious than external status or possessions. I will invest in the kind of woman I am becoming, not merely the image I present.",
    "prayer": "Father, form in me character that is precious in Your sight. Protect me from comparison and from using Proverbs 31 as a standard of condemnation. Shape me through grace into a woman of wisdom, integrity and faithfulness. Amen."
