    "reflection": "“The fear of Yahweh is the beginning of wisdom.”\n\nBiblical wisdom begins with recognising reality correctly:\n\nGod is God.\n\nWe are not.\n\nWisdom is more than intelligence.\n\nA person can be academically brilliant and make disastrously foolish choices.\n\nWisdom asks how truth should shape life.\n\nHow should I speak?\n\nSpend?\n\nRespond?\n\nChoose relationships?\n\nHandle success?\n\nManage conflict?\n\nUse influence?\n\nApproach temptation?\n\nThe fear of the Lord places every decision under God’s authority.\n\nInstead of asking only:\n\n“What can I do?”\n\nwisdom asks:\n\n“What should I do before God?”\n\nThat shift can change an entire life.",
