    "reflection": "“The wise woman builds her house, but the foolish tears it down with her own hands.”\n\nThe principle extends beyond physical houses.\n\nWomen build environments.\n\nFamilies.\n\nTeams.\n\nFriendships.\n\nBusinesses.\n\nMinistries.\n\nCommunities.\n\nOur choices either strengthen what God has entrusted to us or gradually weaken it.\n\nWords can build.\n\nHabits can build.\n\nFinancial wisdom can build.\n\nPrayer can build.\n\nHealthy boundaries can build.\n\nEncouragement can build.\n\nBut constant criticism, dishonesty, uncontrolled anger and foolish decisions can tear down what took years to establish.\n\nBuilding requires intention.\n\nAsk:\n\n“What am I strengthening through the way I live?”\n\nYou do not have to build everything.\n\nBut faithfully build what God has placed in your hands.",
