    "prayer": "Father, show me where I need to grow stronger for the season ahead. Give me discipline to develop, humility to learn and wisdom to recognise my limits. Amen.\n\nMovement 7 progress\n\nDays 182–196 complete.\n\nWe have established:\n\nFear of the Lord → worth → identity → belovedness → strength and dignity → inner beauty → freedom from approval → wisdom → wise influence → wise speech → life-giving words → discernment → trustworthiness → strength.\n\nNext, Days 197–212 complete A Woman After God’s Heart with the other dimensions we deliberately wanted in our Proverbs 31 treatment:\n\ndiligence • enterprise/business • work as worship • stewardship • planning • rest • home and relationships • compassion • hospitality • sisterhood • mentoring • influence • courage concerning the future • legacy • praise rooted in the fear of the Lord.\n\nAnd importantly, Day 198 — Consider the Field — will allow us to deal directly with the often-overlooked fact that the Proverbs 31 woman evaluates and purchases property and engages economically, while still keeping business under wisdom, stewardship and the fear of God.\n\nMovement 7 — A Woman After God’s Heart\n\nMaster Devotionals: Days 197–212\n\nWe now complete this movement by taking godly character into everyday stewardship: work, business, money, home, generosity, relationships, influence and legacy."
